! C22-6578 PROBLEM 3.4, "MODIFIED TRAPEZOIDAL RULE", Method 2, "Separate
! the function evaluation from the summing action in the loop", printed
! pp.28-29 (PDF 29-30), read in the ink.  The problem statement is in
! problem_3_4_method1.strap.
!
!       MTZR2   LX, $1, XW1
!               L(U), B
!               -(N), A
!               /(N), N
!               ST(U), H                    [p.29 from here]
!               E -I(U), 1
!               +(N),A
!               B,STOR
!       LOOP    L(U),TEMP
!               +(N),H
!       STOR    ST(U),TEMP              'new x
!               B,FUNCT                 'branch to f(x) evaluation
!       RTURN   M+(N),ANS               'new partial sum
!               CB, $1, LOOP
!               *(N), H
!               BEW, $
!       ANS     DD(N), 0
!       TEMP    DR(N), (1)
!       H       DR(N), (1)
!       FUNCT   *(N), 8.0               'function evaluator
!               *(N), 8.0
!               B, RTURN
!       XW1     XW, 0.0, 20, $
!       A       DD(N), 0.0              'lower limit
!       B       DD(N), 2.0              'upper limit
!       N       DD(N), 20.0             'no. of strips
!
! THE WHOLE DECK IS THE PAGE: twenty-six statements as printed, data and
! all, in the printed order -- ANS, TEMP and H between the main line and
! FUNCT, where the page puts them -- and with the page's own spacing
! ("E -I(U), 1" with its blank, "+(N),A" without one).  Nothing is the
! deck's but END.
!
! ASSEMBLED WITH ASM=strap2: see problem_3_4_method1.strap.
!
! THE EXPECTED VALUES ARE METHOD 1'S, AND SO IS THE FAULT.  The
! arithmetic is the same sequence of operations on the same data; the
! two B's per loop touch nothing.  So ANS, TEMP, H and the accumulator
! must come out as in problem_3_4_method1.strap, where they are derived
! (Reference Manual rules, tests/problem_3_expected.py p34, and the
! hand checks on them):
!
!   ANS       00CFF7786C2265B0   the sum of f, never multiplied by h
!   TEMP      002F999999999900   x20
!   H         007CCCCCCCCCCCD0   h
!   acc_left  002B913458CD1EC0   f(x20) x h -- not the integral: M+
!                                leaves the accumulator alone
!                                (Reference Manual printed p.88-89)
!
! INJECTION, OBSERVED 2026-11-15 (data side, on a copy of the deck, the
! deck itself untouched): "B DD(N), 2.0" changed to "B DD(N), 3.0".
! FAIL ANS, TEMP, H, acc_left and B_as_assembled; N_as_assembled and the
! PC passed.

MTZR2   LX, $1, XW1
        L(U), B
        -(N), A
        /(N), N
        ST(U), H
        E -I(U), 1
        +(N),A
        B,STOR
LOOP    L(U),TEMP
        +(N),H
STOR    ST(U),TEMP
        B,FUNCT
RTURN   M+(N),ANS
        CB, $1, LOOP
        *(N), H
        BEW, $
ANS     DD(N), 0
TEMP    DR(N), (1)
H       DR(N), (1)
FUNCT   *(N), 8.0
        *(N), 8.0
        B, RTURN
XW1     XW, 0.0, 20, $
A       DD(N), 0.0
B       DD(N), 2.0
N       DD(N), 20.0
        END, MTZR2
